OL,3,GNEWSABrain tumour patient proud of
OL,4,Ahospital recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA brain cancer patient has said he is
OL,7,Fproud of the hospital that treats him
OL,8,Fafter it was recognised for the brain
OL,9,Ftumour treatment, care and research it
OL,10,Fprovides.
OL,12,FFather of two, Matthew White, from
OL,13,FBrighton, was diagnosed with an
OL,14,Fincurable astrocytoma in 2023 after
OL,15,Fexperiencing seizures while playing
OL,16,Ffootball.
OL,18,FThe hospital, run by University
OL,19,FHospitals Sussex NHS Trust, has been
OL,20,Fawarded Tessa Jowell Centre of
OL,21,FExcellence status.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
