OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABrain tumour patient proud of
OL,4,Ahospital recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite said the care provided by the
OL,7,Fbrain tumour teams at the Royal Sussex
OL,8,FCounty Hospital had made a profound
OL,9,Fdifference and the award gave him hope
OL,10,Fthat there was going to be "better
OL,11,Faccess to trials, better access to
OL,12,Ftreatments".
